Package: quired
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: OpenBook project <quired@openbook.invalid>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Mhsbrian/OpenBook
Description: Quire harness host for OpenBook
 Finds the AI coding agents installed in this Linux environment and serves
 them to Quire, OpenBook's agent layer, over the Agent Client Protocol on
 vsock port 7690, and installs and signs in agents for Quire's setup. Its
 admin worker (vsock port 7691) installs Debian prerequisites from a fixed
 list and quired updates. Only the Android host may connect to either.
